 "description": "Bir Borsa \u0130stanbul hissesinin g\u00fcn sonu fiyatlar\u0131: kapan\u0131\u015f, a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 ortalama, g\u00fcn i\u00e7i en d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck/en y\u00fcksek, TL hacim, piyasa de\u011feri; ayn\u0131 g\u00fcn\u00fcn BIST 100 kapan\u0131\u015f\u0131 ve USD/TRY kuru yan\u0131nda. Daily end-of-day prices for a Borsa \u0130stanbul stock (\u0130\u015f Yat\u0131r\u0131m's public data). Veri g\u00fcn sonudur, anl\u0131k fiyat de\u011fildir; tek arac\u0131 kurumun yay\u0131n\u0131d\u0131r. Varsay\u0131lan aral\u0131k: son 30 g\u00fcn.",
